## Interpretive Note (per reviewer)

These are measured test-set errors on the FNO baseline. They are not claims of physical fidelity. The purpose is to establish the **reference** against which Phase 3 SC-FNO improvements will be measured. Any state with high relative L2 (e.g., neutron density `n` at 7.55e-3) is a candidate for physics-informed improvement — but that determination belongs to Phase 3, not Step 2.4.


